But origin activation requires TP linked; we can do origin activation, load, unload while TP on origin. Then we detach TP from origin (making it free). Then we attach TP to destination, do activation, load, unload. Then detach TP from destination (making it free). Then attach TP to origin again for authorize.

Thus we need to do origin's prepare, activate, load, unload first, then destination's prepare, activate, load, unload, then reattach TP to origin for authorize.

But we also need to prepare origin before activation etc. So we need to attach TP to origin for prepare, then keep it for activation, load, unload, then detach, then attach to destination for prepare, activation, load, unload, then detach, then attach to origin for authorize.

